/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 86 0 R
/T (The objective of this problem statement is to develop a prototype of a Purpose-Based Consent Management System that records, tracks, and enforces user consent in real time for a synthetic service.)
/E (The objective of this problem statement is to develop a prototype of a Purpose-Based Consent Management System that records, tracks, and enforces user consent in real time for a synthetic service.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
